# Phase 2: Install Docker

## Ubuntu Installation

```bash
sudo apt update
sudo apt install docker.io -y

sudo systemctl start docker
sudo systemctl enable docker
```

Verify installation:

```bash
docker --version
```

Expected output:

```bash
Docker version 26.x
```

