# Phase 3: Run Your First Container

Run Nginx:

```bash
docker run nginx
```

Nginx starts but occupies the terminal.

Run in detached mode:

```bash
docker run -d nginx
```

Check running containers:

```bash
docker ps
```

Example:

```bash
CONTAINER ID   IMAGE
1234abcd       nginx
```

