# Phase 4: Understand Docker Architecture

```text
Docker Client
      |
      v
Docker Daemon
      |
      +--> Images
      +--> Containers
      +--> Networks
      +--> Volumes
```

## Components

### Docker Client

Commands you type:

```bash
docker run
docker build
docker ps
```

### Docker Daemon

Performs all container operations.

### Docker Registry

Stores images.

Examples:

- Docker Hub
- AWS ECR
- Azure ACR
- Google Artifact Registry

