# Phase 5: Images vs Containers

## Image

Blueprint/template used to create containers.

Examples:

```text
nginx
ubuntu
mysql
redis
```

## Container

Running instance of an image.

Example:

```text
Image
 └── nginx

Containers
 ├── nginx-container-1
 └── nginx-container-2
```

Analogy:

```text
Class → Object

Image → Container
```

