# Phase 8: Port Mapping

Containers have isolated networking.

Nginx listens on:

```text
Port 80
```

Expose it to the host machine:

```bash
docker run -d -p 8080:80 nginx
```

Meaning:

```text
Host Port      Container Port
8080      ->   80
```

Visit:

```text
http://localhost:8080
```

### Kubernetes Mapping

```text
Docker Port Mapping
        ↓
Kubernetes Service
```

