# Phase 10: Build Your Own Image

Project Structure:

```text
my-app
├── app.py
└── Dockerfile
```

## app.py

```python
from flask import Flask

app = Flask(__name__)

@app.route('/')
def home():
    return "Hello Docker"

app.run(host="0.0.0.0")
```

---

## Dockerfile

```dockerfile
FROM python:3.11

WORKDIR /app

COPY . .

RUN pip install flask

CMD ["python","app.py"]
```

Build image:

```bash
docker build -t my-python-app .
```

Verify image:

```bash
docker images
```

Run image:

```bash
docker run -p 5000:5000 my-python-app
```

Test:

```text
http://localhost:5000
```

Expected:

```text
Hello Docker
```

