# Phase 14: Docker Compose

Managing multiple containers individually is difficult.

Example Application:

```text
Frontend
Backend
MySQL
Redis
```

Create:

```yaml
services:

  frontend:
    image: nginx

  backend:
    image: my-api

  mysql:
    image: mysql

  redis:
    image: redis
```

Start everything:

```bash
docker compose up -d
```

View containers:

```bash
docker ps
```

Stop everything:

```bash
docker compose down
```

### Kubernetes Mapping

| Docker Compose | Kubernetes |
| -------------- | ---------- |
| Service | Service |
| Container | Pod |
| Volume | PV/PVC |
| Environment Variables | ConfigMap/Secret |
| Compose File | YAML Manifest |

